{"seq":3,"slug":"natural-hazards","title":"大学地理学 — 自然灾害","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/geography/environmental-geography/natural-hazards","wordCount":1084,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学地理学-自然灾害\">大学地理学 — 自然灾害</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>自然灾害地理学研究地震、火山、洪涝、干旱、台风等自然事件的时空分布规律、致灾机理与社会影响。该领域将物理地理过程与人类脆弱性分析结合，构建灾害风险评估与减灾对策的科学基础。</p>\n<h3 id=\"灾害分类与成因\">灾害分类与成因</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>灾害类型</th>\n<th>主要成因</th>\n<th>典型案例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>地震</td>\n<td>板块边界应力释放</td>\n<td>2008年汶川地震 (<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 7.9)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>火山喷发</td>\n<td>岩浆上升与气体膨胀</td>\n<td>2022年汤加火山 (VEI 5-6)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>洪涝</td>\n<td>强降水超过流域排水能力</td>\n<td>2021年郑州暴雨</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>台风/飓风</td>\n<td>热带海面蒸发驱动气旋发展</td>\n<td>台风利奇马 (2019)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>干旱</td>\n<td>持续降水偏少与蒸散偏高</td>\n<td>2022年长江流域特大干旱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑坡/泥石流</td>\n<td>坡体失稳 + 水分触发</td>\n<td>舟曲特大泥石流 (2010)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"地震灾害与风险评估\">地震灾害与风险评估</h3><p>地震释放的能量用震级表示。里氏震级 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 基于最大振幅的对数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_L = \\log_{10} A - \\log_{10} A_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span cla